WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.253 --> 00:00:01.407
- It has a sweetness.

00:00:01.407 --> 00:00:03.655
It's not like it's a dessert.

00:00:03.655 --> 00:00:04.488
- Right.

00:00:04.488 --> 00:00:05.321
- It's a savory meal.

00:00:05.321 --> 00:00:06.154
- Yeah.

00:00:06.154 --> 00:00:07.118
- But it's quite sweet.

00:00:07.118 --> 00:00:09.307
- Like on a hot summer
day, this would be amazing.

00:00:09.307 --> 00:00:11.890
(upbeat music)

00:00:13.976 --> 00:00:16.684
- We are in Korea Town in
Los Angeles, at Mimimyunga,

00:00:16.684 --> 00:00:18.502
to try the best soba from Korea.

00:00:18.502 --> 00:00:21.124
It was featured in
Michelin Guide from Korea,

00:00:21.124 --> 00:00:23.814
and they are doing really,
really, really, really good.

00:00:23.814 --> 00:00:24.860
- Oh, so it's like a restaurant chain?

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:25.930
- Right, right, yeah.

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:26.799
- Oh, cool.

00:00:26.799 --> 00:00:29.127
- Soba's originally from
Japanese, but this restaurant

00:00:29.127 --> 00:00:30.400
is from Korea.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.068
- The main thing that makes it stand out

00:00:32.068 --> 00:00:33.603
is that it can be served cold.

00:00:33.603 --> 00:00:36.440
- They also serve warm soba here.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:38.356
- Usually noodles, you
know, you have it in broth,

00:00:38.356 --> 00:00:39.647
but this one you have it separate,

00:00:39.647 --> 00:00:41.120
and you can dip it in the broth.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.322
- I like sweet noodles, I don't know why.

00:00:43.322 --> 00:00:46.652
I don't like sweet drinks,
but I like sweet dishes.

00:00:46.652 --> 00:00:47.860
- It was sugary?

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:49.610
- It's kind of sweet.

00:00:51.149 --> 00:00:53.423
- This is much different than I expected.

00:00:53.423 --> 00:00:54.541
This plating though,

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:57.024
it reminds me a little bit
of ramen in the presentation.

00:00:57.024 --> 00:00:58.686
- It does, I looks like
ramen but it's weird.

00:00:58.686 --> 00:00:59.951
- But it's cold.

00:00:59.951 --> 00:01:00.784
- Cause like, when you
feel the bowl it's cold.

00:01:00.784 --> 00:01:01.704
- It's real cold.

00:01:01.704 --> 00:01:04.024
- Should we start eating?

00:01:04.024 --> 00:01:05.172
- Oops.

00:01:05.172 --> 00:01:06.043
- So good.

00:01:06.043 --> 00:01:06.889
It's so good.

00:01:06.889 --> 00:01:07.940
- It's so good.

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:09.034
- It's really good with the wasabi.

00:01:09.034 --> 00:01:10.206
I do taste the sweetness.

00:01:10.206 --> 00:01:11.039
- Right?

00:01:11.039 --> 00:01:11.872
It is sweet, yeah.

00:01:11.872 --> 00:01:13.171
- Yeah, there is some sweetness there.

00:01:13.171 --> 00:01:15.457
- The broth is like, really steamed.

00:01:15.457 --> 00:01:17.645
When they make the
broth, it takes 24 hours.

00:01:17.645 --> 00:01:18.798
