00:01:18.798 --> 00:01:19.631
- Yeah.

00:01:19.631 --> 00:01:20.464
- Wow.

00:01:20.464 --> 00:01:21.297
- Whoa.

00:01:21.297 --> 00:01:22.754
- And also, the noodles
soak in the broth so well,

00:01:22.754 --> 00:01:23.950
so you can taste it really well.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:24.942
- Yeah, yeah.

00:01:24.942 --> 00:01:27.167
You guys never tried an uni before, right?

00:01:27.167 --> 00:01:28.005
This is uni.

00:01:28.005 --> 00:01:28.838
