00:02:09.261 --> 00:02:10.662
- This beef is so good.

00:02:10.662 --> 00:02:11.723
- Beef is so good.

00:02:11.723 --> 00:02:12.966
- Yeah, beef is so good.

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:14.364
