00:02:28.068 --> 00:02:28.901
- It's really perfect.

00:02:28.901 --> 00:02:30.519
- Yeah.

00:02:30.519 --> 00:02:32.623
This is warm soba we just had,

00:02:32.623 --> 00:02:35.194
